# Session dialog (Lock, Sleep, Log Out, Restart, Shut Down). Do NOT press Return on Sleep/Log Out/Restart/Shut Down. Check in each look.
rec ses-open 1 ipc panels open session IRICE-TEST
note Open curve compared with QML: Material about 0.3 s, Glass about 0.4 s.
wait 1
key -k Right -k Right -k Right -k Right -k Right -k Right
wait 1
shot ses-right
note Six Right presses stop at Shut Down (the last one); the current one is accent (Glass) / its shape filled (Material).
key -k Left -k Left -k Left -k Left -k Left -k Left
wait 1
shot ses-left
note Six Left presses stop at Lock (the first one); current one marked as before.
ptr move 700 540 sleep 200 glide 1200 540 300
wait 1
shot ses-glide
note Gliding across the five the current one follows the pointer (the last hovered action is current).
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 down glide 965 540 100
shot ses-press
note Pressed and held while gliding a few px: the swell (Material) / 94 % (Glass) stays and does not restart. NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness.
ptr move 960 540 up
wait 1
rec ses-close 0.5 key -k Escape
note Escape closes in about 192 ms (QML vs Rust).
